            "review_title": "Review at Hutong - Hotpot Paradise",
            "review_text": "Howietp\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam85 contributions\n0\nWould come again\nJan 2019 • Family\nHutong hotpot is a very nice alternative to the standard hot pot places in the city. Its spicy broth is tasty, and not overwhelmingly hot or oily like its mainland or Taiwan ‘ma la’ counterparts. The best part of the menu was actually the braised intestines and stomach. \n\nThree adults ate very well got 700k. Great value.\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2019",
