            "review_title": "Review at Hutong - Hotpot Paradise",
            "review_text": "Rianna L\n1 contribution\n0\ncharged for a dish we didn’t order\nNov 2018 • Couples\nas soon as we sat down a waiter dropped a chicken dish on our table. we thought it was free because they sat it down before we ordered and walked away. they also do this with all of the little appetizers like peanuts and anchovies. we were told we couldn’t order a single broth, we had to pay for the split broth. they will charge you for everything including the napkins even if you don’t use them. food was fresh, but for the price it’s not worth it. pay attention to what they are charging you for... if it is on the table you are getting charged. we will never dine here again as there are many better options in the city for a much better price.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 27, 2018",
