            "review_text": "Bibimaru\nVietnam117 contributions\n0\nGreat hotpot restaurant for many occasions\nDec 2017 • Family\nVery crowded restaurant, prior reservation is strongly recommend. The restaurant has a make-your-own sauce bar where you can customize what base, what flavor goes into your sauce, which is pretty cool. Meat selection is good and fresh. Their refreshing herbal menu is good, too, you should try if you are bored with sodas and bottled water.\nIt wilk cost about 350,000 VND per person if you don't drink wine. Very reasonable price considering their quality and location.\nRead more\nWritten January 1, 2018",
